# A file dialog (Windows' Open or Save) in front (decision 181): a pill of its
# own sits under it. Clicked, the island is lent to the dialog: it hangs
# under it with the card that picks files, and is back in its own place when
# that card closes, however it closes.
# Default tokens: idle pill 160 wide, an expanded card 480. A 1000-wide screen.

scenario: the dialog's pill opens the picking card, hung under the dialog
screen 1000
restore left
panel timer
panel search picker
picker 300                          -> Expanded expanded=search picking=yes pill=60 spot=left    # 480 wide, centred on 300
picker-moved 600                    -> pill=360                 # the dialog moved
picker-gone                         -> Idle picking=no pill=0   # nothing left to give a file to: back in its place

scenario: with no dialog the island is as ever
panel timer
panel search picker
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer picking=no
card search                         -> Expanded expanded=search picking=no   # Search from its button or shortcut: in the island's own place

scenario: the card closed any way sends the island home
screen 1000
panel search picker
picker 300
esc                                 -> Idle picking=no
picker 300
outside                             -> Idle picking=no
picker 300
close-card search                   -> Idle picking=no          # a file was given to the dialog
picker 300
top-click                           -> Idle picking=no

scenario: another card instead of the picking one is in the island's own place
screen 1000
panel timer
panel search picker
picker 300                          -> picking=yes
card timer                          -> Expanded expanded=timer picking=no pill=260

scenario: under a dialog at the screen's edge the card stays on the screen
screen 1000
panel search picker
picker 990                          -> pill=520

scenario: with no picking card the pill does nothing; nor while the island is hidden
panel timer
picker 400                          -> Idle picking=no
panel search picker
hide
picker 400                          -> Hidden picking=no

scenario: the pill takes the island from whatever it showed, and it comes back to that
panel search picker
start a
alert ping                          -> Alert
picker 400                          -> Expanded expanded=search
esc                                 -> Compact picking=no
click                               -> Expanded expanded=a
picker 400                          -> Expanded expanded=search picking=yes

scenario: a critical alert takes the island back
panel search picker
start a
picker 400
alert fire critical                 -> Alert picking=no

scenario: a moving dialog or one going changes nothing when the island isn't lent
screen 1000
panel timer keep
panel search picker
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer
picker-moved 300                    -> picking=no pill=260
picker-gone                         -> Expanded expanded=timer
card search
picker-gone                         -> Idle                     # Search open in its own place still closes: it was picking for that dialog
